[C#m] Tujhse Hi Karu Gallan..        [G#m] Dil Di Sachiyan..
[A] Tere Hi Liye..        Bandhi [B] Doora Pakkiyan..
[C#m] Chhadiya Me Jag Sara,        [G#m] Chadi Duniya..
